ded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://nebula-sh.ccwu.cc/temp/12-%E5%88%9D%E9%9F%B3_%E8%80%B3%E6%9C%BA%E5%A4%9C%E8%89%B2.gif\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"14-听雨书桌与猫.gif\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://nebula-sh.ccwu.cc/temp/14-%E5%90%AC%E9%9B%A8%E4%B9%A6%E6%A1%8C%E4%B8%8E%E7%8C%AB.gif\"/></p>\n<p>欢迎各位朋友建议+提 issue\nui 方面希望给出更多的建议，争取赶上 mac 的体验！</p>\n<p>注：\n使用前一定要先安装压缩包内的 maple font ，不然会显示异常\n喜欢的朋友可以点个 star 哦</p>\n<p>项目地址： <a href=\"https://github.com/Kuddev/pebrel\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Kuddev/pebrel</a></p>\n", "last_modified": 1791469352, "replies": 54, "id": 1247192}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 73752, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9792, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 317150, "username": "sft6888", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/sft6888", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ecd6/9eb3/317150_mini.png?m=1791527208", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ecd6/9eb3/317150_normal.png?m=1791527208", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ecd6/9eb3/317150_large.png?m=1791527208", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ecd6/9eb3/317150_xlarge.png?m=1791527208", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ecd6/9eb3/317150_xxlarge.png?m=1791527208", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ecd6/9eb3/317150_xxxlarge.png?m=1791527208", "created": 1526624238, "last_modified": 1791527208, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "iloveyoucool", "last_touched": 1791528759, "title": "你们用 AI 写代码，会每次都看它改了什么吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247211", "created": 1791475927, "deleted": 0, "content": "想问问大家，让 AI 改完代码以后，你们会逐行看 diff ，还是功能试一下没问题就提交？\r\n\r\n只改几行还好，一次改了十几个文件，看起来也挺费劲。但完全不看，又怕它顺手改了不该改的地方。\r\n\r\n你们一般怎么检查？有没有哪些部分是一定会自己看的？", "content_rendered": "想问问大家，让 AI 改完代码以后，你们会逐行看 diff ，还是功能试一下没问题就提交？<br /><br />只改几行还好，一次改了十几个文件，看起来也挺费劲。但完全不看，又怕它顺手改了不该改的地方。<br /><br />你们一般怎么检查？有没有哪些部分是一定会自己看的？", "last_modified": 1791475927, "replies": 52, "id": 1247211}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/a4a0/42cf/171_large.png?m=1782097568", "name": "invest", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/a4a0/42cf/171_normal.png?m=1782097568", "title": "投资", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/invest", "topics": 3860, "footer": "", "header": "Can you make money with money?", "title_alternative": "Invest", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/a4a0/42cf/171_mini.png?m=1782097568", "stars": 4669, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 171, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 725786, "username": "shalou8023", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/shalou8023", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fd03f18aa753b50562ab5f3ebb750b70?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fd03f18aa753b50562ab5f3ebb750b70?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fd03f18aa753b50562ab5f3ebb750b70?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1734423198, "last_modified": 1783562680, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "shalou8023", "last_touched": 1791494352, "title": "今天的大 A 有 V 友赚钱吗", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1247058", "created": 1791443202, "deleted": 0, "content": "如题，已经麻了， [投资请去正规市场] 含金量不断上升。。", "content_rendered": "<p>如题，已经麻